# Public site origin without trailing slash. Must match the canonical host users and Google should index.
# If empty: SeoHead uses window.location.origin at runtime; build omits absolute canonical/OG in index.html; no sitemap.xml in dist.
# Production: set to your live URL (e.g. Vercel production or custom domain) so dist/sitemap.xml and robots.txt are correct.
VITE_SITE_URL=

# Vercel: after you add a custom domain, configure 301 redirects (e.g. www → apex) in Project → Domains / vercel.json redirects — keep this value aligned with the primary hostname.
